<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rut Nhoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rut</para>
  <para style="mt1">Rut Nhoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Elimelek Tutu Kɔtena Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1"/>Bere a na atemmufo di Israel so no, ɔkɔm baa asase no so. Ɔbarima bi a ofi Betlehem wɔ Yuda ne ne yere ne ne mmabarima baanu tutu fii asase no so kɔtenaa Moab. <verse eid="RUT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2"/>Na ɔbarima no din de Elimelek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wonyaa din Efrati fii abusua a Elimelek fi mu no. Ɛno nti, Elimelek de nʼabusua din no ɔmantam a ɛbɛn Betlehem a ɛtɔ da a wɔfrɛ no Betlehem Efrata no (<char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 4:11">4.11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:19">1 Mose 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:12">1 Sam 17.12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mika 5.2</ref></char>).</char></note> na ne yere nso din de Naomi. Ne mmabarima baanu no nso, na wɔn din de Mahlon ne Kilion. Wɔyɛ Efratifo a wofi Betlehem wɔ Yuda. Wɔkɔɔ Moab kɔtenaa hɔ. <verse eid="RUT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3"/>Ɛbaa sɛ Naomi kunu Elimelek wu ma ɛkaa ne mmabarima baanu no. <verse eid="RUT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4"/>Wɔwarewaree Moabfo mmea. Na ɔbaako din de Orpa na nea ɔka ho no nso din de Rut. Wɔtenaa hɔ bɛyɛ sɛ mfe du no, <verse eid="RUT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5"/>Mahlon ne Kilion nso wuwui. Enti ɛmaa Naomi tenaa ase a wahwere ne mmabarima baanu no ne ne kunu.<verse eid="RUT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6"/>Bere a ɔtee wɔ Moab hɔ sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abɛdom ne nkurɔfo a wɔwɔ Yuda na wama wɔn aduan no, Naomi ne ne nsenom yi yɛɛ ahoboa sɛ wɔrefi Moab asan akɔ ne kurom. <verse eid="RUT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7"/>Ɔne ne nsenom baanu yi tutu fii beae hɔ faa kwan a ɛde wɔn bɛkɔ akosi Yuda so.<verse eid="RUT 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8"/>Afei, Naomi ka kyerɛɛ ne nsenom yi se, “Monsan nkɔ mo nanom fi. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo nni no yiye sɛnea mo ne awufo ne me dii no yiye no. <verse eid="RUT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmoa mo mu biara na onya ɔhome wɔ okunu foforo fi.” Afei, ofifew wɔn ano na wɔn nyinaa maa wɔn nne so sui.<verse eid="RUT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10"/>Na wɔka kyerɛɛ Naomi se, “Yɛne wo bɛsan akɔ wo nkurɔfo nkyɛn.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11"/>Nanso Naomi kae se, “Me mma, monsan nkɔ fie. Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ mo ne me kɔ? Merekɔwo mmabarima bio a wobetumi awareware mo ana? <verse eid="RUT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12"/>Me mma, monsan nkɔ fie. Manyin, sɛ meware kunu bio a, ɛrenyɛ yiye. Mpo, sɛ midwen sɛ anidaso bi wɔ hɔ ma me sɛ nso anadwo yi ara minya okunu na me ne no wo mmabarima a, <verse eid="RUT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13"/>mobɛtwɛn kosi sɛ wobenyinyin? Mobɛtena atwɛn wɔn ana? Dabi, me mma. Asɛm no yɛ den ma me sen mo, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi ne nsa afi me so!”<verse eid="RUT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14"/>Wɔsan twaa adwo bio. Afei, Orpa few nʼase ano de gyaa no kwan, nanso Rut bebaree Naomi sɛ ɔne no bɛtena.<verse eid="RUT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15"/>Nanso Naomi ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Hwɛ, wo kora asan kɔ ne nkurɔfo ne nʼanyame nkyɛn. Ɛsɛ sɛ wo nso woyɛ saa ara.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16"/>Na Rut buae se, “Nhyɛ me sɛ mimfi wo nkyɛn nsan nkɔ. Baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, mɛkɔ hɔ bi na baabiara a wobɛtena no nso, mɛtena hɔ bi. Wo nkurɔfo bɛyɛ me nkurɔfo na wo Nyankopɔn ayɛ me Nyankopɔn. <verse eid="RUT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17"/>Baabi a wubewu no, mewu hɔ bi na wɔasie me hɔ. Sɛ mamma owu antetew me ne wo ntam na ɛnam biribi foforo biara so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntwe mʼaso.” <verse eid="RUT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18"/>Enti Naomi huu sɛ Rut ayɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔne no bɛkɔ no, ogyaa ne pɛ maa no.<verse eid="RUT 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19"/>Ɛno nti, wɔn baanu no toaa wɔn akwantu no so. Bere a woduu Betlehem no, wɔn nti kurow mu no nyinaa bɔɔ twi. Mmea no bisae se, “Naomi ni ana?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20"/>Ɔkae se, “Mommfrɛ me Naomi, na mmom, momfrɛ me Mara, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama asetena ayɛ nwen ama me. <verse eid="RUT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21"/>Merefi ha akɔ no na mewɔ biribiara, nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de me aba fie nsapan. Adɛn nti na mofrɛ me Naomi wɔ bere a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama mahu amane na Otumfo de saa abɛbrɛsɛ yi aba me so?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22"/>Enti Naomi fi Moab bae a, nʼase Rut, Moabni babun ka ne ho. Woduu Betlehem atokotwa bere mfiase no mu.<verse eid="RUT 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Rut Di Boas Afuw Mu Mpɛpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1"/>Ɔbarima ɔdefo a na ɔyɛ okunini bi tenaa Betlehem a na wɔfrɛ no Boas. Na ɔyɛ Naomi kunu Elimelek busuani.<verse eid="RUT 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2"/>Da koro bi, Rut, Moabni, ka kyerɛɛ Naomi se, “Ma menkɔ afuw mu na minkodi obiara a menya nʼanim anuonyam akyi nkɔboaboa atoko ase.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Na Naomi kae se, “Eye, me babea, kɔ.” <verse eid="RUT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3"/>Enti Rut kɔ kodii atwafo no akyi. Na nea ɛbae ne sɛ, ohuu sɛ ɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ Boas a ɔyɛ nʼase Elimelek busuani no afuw mu.<verse eid="RUT 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4"/>Bere a ɔwɔ hɔ no, Boas fi Betlehem bae. Okyiaa atwafo no se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo ntena!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Atwafo no gyee so se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5"/>Boas bisaa ne sohwɛfo no se, “Ababaa bɛn na ɔwɔ nohɔ hɔ no?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6"/>Sohwɛfo no buae se, “Ɔyɛ ababaa bi a ofi Moab a ɔne Naomi bae. <verse eid="RUT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7"/>Anɔpa yi ara na obisaa me se, obetumi adi atwafo no akyi aboaboa atoko ano ana? Ɔyɛ nsiyɛfo a bere kakraa bi na ɔde homee wɔ pata no ase hɔ.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8"/>Boas kɔɔ hɔ kɔka kyerɛɛ Rut se, “Me babea tie. Wo ne yɛn ntena ha ara na boaboa atoko; nkɔ afuw foforo biara mu. Di mmea a wɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ mʼafuw yi mu no akyi pɛɛ. <verse eid="RUT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9"/>Hwɛ faako a wɔretwa wɔ afuw no mu na di wɔn akyi. Mabɔ mmerante no kɔkɔ sɛ wɔnnhaw wo. Na sɛ osukɔm de wo a, nom nsu a wɔakɔsaw afi abura no mu no bi.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10"/>Rut butuwii, de nʼanim kyerɛɛ fam daa no ase. Na ɔkae se, “Adɛn nti na manya saa adom yi wɔ wʼani so, me a meyɛ ɔnanani yi?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11"/>Boas buae se, “Nea woayɛ ama wʼase efi wo kunu wu akyi nyinaa no, wɔaka akyerɛ me, sɛ wufii wʼagya ne wo na ne wo man mu na wo ne nnipa a wunnim wɔn wɔ baabiara bɛtenae no. <verse eid="RUT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn a woanya guankɔbea wɔ ne ntaban ase no nnom wo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13"/>Na ɔno nso kae se, “Ma menkɔ so nnya wʼanim adom daa, me wura. Woama me awerɛkyekye na woakasa akyerɛ wʼafenaa ayamye so, me a mensɛ na memfata wo nnwumayɛfo no mu baako mpo no.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14"/>Eduu adidibere no, Boas frɛɛ no se, “Bra ma yennidi. Wutumi de wo brodo no bɔ nsa biara a wopɛ mu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:14">Enti ɔne nʼawitwafo no tenaa ase na Boas maa no aduan sen sɛnea obetumi adi mpo. <verse eid="RUT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15"/>Bere a Rut san kɔɔ nʼadwuma so bio no, Boas ka kyerɛɛ ne mmerante no se, “Momma no mmoaboa atoko no ano mfi nʼafiafi no mu na munnsiw no kwan. <verse eid="RUT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16"/>Na munyiyi afiafi no mu de no bi nnyae mu ngu fam mma no na ɔnsesaw, na monnhaw no.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17"/>Enti Rut sesaw atoko no wɔ hɔ da mu no nyinaa na ɔporow atoko no saa anwummere no, onyaa bɛyɛ lita aduonu abien. <verse eid="RUT 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18"/>Ɔsoa de kɔɔ kurom, de kɔkyerɛɛ nʼase. Afei, Rut de nʼawiaduan a ogyaw no maa no.<verse eid="RUT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19"/>Naomi hui no, ɔteɛɛ mu se, “Ɛdɔɔso yiye! Na ɛhe na nnɛ woboaboaa saa atoko yi nyinaa ano fi? Ɛhe na wokɔyɛɛ adwuma? <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira nea ɔboaa wo no!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Rut kaa ɔbarima a ɔyɛɛ adwuma wɔ nʼafum no ho asɛm kyerɛɛ nʼase no, ɔtoaa so kae se, “Nea meyɛɛ adwuma wɔ nʼafum no, wɔfrɛ no Boas.”<verse eid="RUT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20"/>Naomi ka kyerɛɛ nʼase no se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira no. Ɔrekyerɛ yɛn ne wo kunu a wawu no nʼayamye. Saa ɔbarima no yɛ abusuafo a wɔbɛn yɛn pɛɛ no mu baako a ɔyɛ abusua no mu ogyefo baako.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21"/>Rut kae se, “Nea ɛka ho bio ne sɛ, mpo, Boas ka kyerɛɛ me se, mensan mmra na me ne nʼawitwafo no mmɛtena nkosi bere a wobewie otwa no.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22"/>Naomi teɛɛ mu se, “Anwonwasɛm ni! Yɛ nea ɔka no. Wo ne nʼadwumayɛfo no ntena nkosi sɛ wobewie otwa no. Wʼasom bedwo wo wɔ hɔ sen afuw biara mu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23"/>Enti Rut ne mmea a wɔwɔ Boas afum hɔ no yɛɛ adwuma. Ɔne wɔn boaboaa atoko no ano kosii atokotwa no awiei. Afei, ɔne wɔn twaa awi nso. Nanso saa bere no nyinaa na ɔne nʼase na ɛte.<verse eid="RUT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Rut Wɔ Awiporowbea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1"/>Da bi Naomi ka kyerɛɛ Rut se, “Me babea, bere adu sɛ mehwehwɛ ofi a wobɛtena mu na wubenya nea ehia wo biara. <verse eid="RUT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2"/>Boas yɛ yɛn busuani pɛɛ na wayɛ adɔe mmoroso sɛ wama wo ne nʼadwumayɛfo aboaboa atoko ano. Anadwo yi, obehuhuw atoko so wɔ awiporowbea hɔ. <verse eid="RUT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3"/>Enti yɛ nea merekyerɛ wo yi. Guare na tutu aduhuam gu wo ho na fa wo ntade pa bi hyɛ. Afei, kɔ awiporowbea hɔ, nanso mma Boas nhu wo kosi sɛ obedidi awie. <verse eid="RUT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4"/>Hwɛ na hu baabi a ɔda hɔ yiye, afei, kɔ na koyi ne nan ho nkataho na da hɔ. Ɔbɛka nea ɔpɛ sɛ woyɛ akyerɛ wo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5"/>Rut kae se, “Biribiara a wobɛka akyerɛ me sɛ menyɛ no, mɛyɛ.” <verse eid="RUT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6"/>Enti ɔkɔɔ awiporowbea hɔ anadwo no, na ɔyɛɛ nea nʼase kyerɛɛ no no mu biara.<verse eid="RUT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7"/>Boas didi wiee no a ne honhom aba ne ho no, ɔkyeaa ne ho too atoko mmoano no ho, na ɔfaa mu dae. Rut yɛɛ nwaa koyii ne nan ho nkataho na ɔdaa hɔ. <verse eid="RUT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8"/>Anadwo dasum no, Boas bɔɔ pitiri dan ne ho. Ɛyɛɛ no nwonwa sɛ ohuu sɛ ɔbea da ne nan ase.<verse eid="RUT 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9"/>Obisae se, “Na hena ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Obuae se, “Ɛyɛ me wo somfo Rut. Trɛw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Trɛw a obi trɛw nʼatade ano de gu ɔbea so no kyerɛ aware ho bammɔ.</char></note> wo nkataso no mu kakra gu me so na woyɛ mʼabusua gyefo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10"/>Na Boas kae se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wo, me babea! Worekyerɛ abusua dɔ a bi mmaa da sɛ woankodi aberantewa bi akyi, sɛ ɔwɔ sika anaa ɔyɛ ohiani. <verse eid="RUT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11"/>Afei, me babea, mma hwee nhaw wo. Mɛyɛ nea ehia wo nyinaa. Me kurow yi mu nnipa nyinaa nim sɛ woyɛ ɔbea a wudi wo ho ni. <verse eid="RUT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12"/>Nanso akwanside baako wɔ hɔ. Ɛyɛ nokware turodoo sɛ meyɛ mo abusua agyefo mu baako de, nanso ɔbarima foforo bi wɔ hɔ a ɔyɛ obusuani titiriw sen me. <verse eid="RUT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13"/>Tena ha anadwo yi na sɛ ade kye a, me ne no bɛkasa. Sɛ ɛyɛ ne pɛ sɛ obegye wo a, ɛno de ma ho kwan na ɔnware wo. Na sɛ ɛnyɛ ne pɛ nso a, ɛno de, ɔkwan biara so, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, mɛware wo! Enti da ha ma ade nkye.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14"/>Enti Rut daa ne nan ho kosii adekyee nanso ɔsɔree ansa na anim tetew. Na Boas ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ɛnsɛ sɛ obi hu sɛ ɔbea bi bɛdaa awiporowbea ha.”<verse eid="RUT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15"/>Boas toaa so kae se, “Fa wʼatade nguguso no bra na trɛw mu.” Ɔsesaw atoko no susukoraa asia guu mu na ɔboaa no ma ɔde hyɛɛ nʼakyi. Na Boas san kɔɔ kurow no mu.<verse eid="RUT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16"/>Rut baa nʼase Naomi nkyɛn no, obisaa no se, “Me babea, ekosii dɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Rut kaa biribiara a Boas yɛ maa no no kyerɛɛ Naomi, <verse eid="RUT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17"/>na ɔtoaa so se, “Ɔmaa me atoko susukoraa asia kae se, ‘Mfa nsapan nkɔ wʼase nkyɛn.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18"/>Afei, Naomi kae se, “Me ba, twɛn kosi sɛ wubehu nea ebesi. Ɔbarima no renna so kosi sɛ asɛm no besi nnɛ yi ara.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Boas Ware Rut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1"/>Boas kɔɔ kurow no pon ano kɔtenaa ase wɔ hɔ. Bere a obusuani gyefo titiriw a ɔkaa ne ho asɛm no baa hɔ no, Boas frɛɛ no kae se, “Mʼadamfo, mesrɛ wo bra na mepɛ sɛ me ne wo twetwe nkɔmmɔ.” Enti wɔtenaa ase.<verse eid="RUT 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2"/>Na Boas frɛɛ kurow no mu ntuanofo du sɛ wɔmmɛtena ase sɛ nnansefo. <verse eid="RUT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3"/>Na Boas ka kyerɛɛ obusuani gyefo titiriw no se, “Wunim Naomi a ofi Moab bae no. Ɔretɔn asase a na ɛyɛ yɛn busuani Elimelek dea no. <verse eid="RUT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4"/>Misusuw sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ, me ne wo di ho nkɔmmɔ na sɛ wopɛ a, woagye. Sɛ wopɛ asase no a, tɔ no ha yi ara wɔ saa nnansefo yi anim. Na sɛ wompɛ nso a, ma mente no mprempren ara, efisɛ sɛ woantumi annye a, me ne onipa a midi wʼakyi wɔ abusua no mu a ɛsɛ sɛ migye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Na ɔbarima no buae se, “Megye.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5"/>Afei, Boas ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Sɛ wotɔ asase no fi Naomi nkyɛn a, na ɛsɛ sɛ woware Moabni okunafo Rut no. Sɛ ɛba saa a, ɔbɛwo mma a ne kunu din bɛda wɔn so na asase no bɛtena abusua no mu.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6"/>Ɛhɔ ara na abusua mu gyefo titiriw no kae se, “Ɛno de, merentumi ntɔ asase no, efisɛ ɛbɛhaw mʼankasa mʼagyapade. Tɔ asase no na merentumi ntɔ.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7"/>Saa bere no, na ɛyɛ Israel amanne sɛ, sɛ obiara redan nʼade bi a watɔ no ɔkwan pa so ama obi foforo a, ɔworɔw ne mpaboa de ma nea ɔtɔ no. Wɔyɛ saa wɔ bagua mu de hyɛ adetɔ no mu den. <verse eid="RUT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8"/>Enti abusua gyefo titiriw no worɔw ne mpaboa ka kyerɛɛ Boas se, “Wo ara tɔ asase no.”<verse eid="RUT 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9"/>Na Boas ka kyerɛɛ ɔman no ntuanofo no ne dɔm a wɔatwa ahyia hɔ no se, “Nnɛ matɔ Elimelek, Kilion ne Mahlon agyapade a ɛwɔ Naomi nsam, na moyɛ ɛho nnansefo. <verse eid="RUT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10"/>Menam asase no tɔ so afa Rut a ɔyɛ Moabni a ɔyɛ Mahlon kunafo no sɛ me yere. Ne saa nti, sɛ ɔwo ɔbabarima a, ɔbɛfa ne kunu a wawu no abusua din na wafa abusua agyapade a ɛwɔ ne kurom ha nso. Nnɛ, mo nyinaa moyɛ nnansefo.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11"/>Afei, ntuanofo no ne ɔmanfo no nyinaa sɔre gyina kae se, “Yɛyɛ nnansefo! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmoa mma ɔbea a afei na ɔreba wo fi no nyɛ sɛ Rahel ne Lea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israelfo nyinaa ase fi Rahel ne Lea mu. Saa ara na Dawid ne Agyenkwa no yɛ Rut asefo.</char></note> a wɔn mu na Israel aman nyinaa fi no. Wobɛyɛ ɔkɛse wɔ Efrata na woagye din wɔ Betlehem. <verse eid="RUT 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mfa ababaa yi so mma wo asefo a wɔbɛyɛ sɛ yɛn agya Peres<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Peres yɛ Boas aseni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:3">Mat 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:33">Luk 3.33</ref></char>).</char></note> a ɔyɛ Tamar ne Yuda babarima no.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Boas Asefo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13"/>Enti Boas waree Rut de no kɔɔ ne fi. Afei, ɔkɔɔ ne ho na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma onyinsɛnee na ɔwoo ɔbabarima. <verse eid="RUT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14"/>Na kurow no mu mmea ka kyerɛɛ Naomi se, “Anuonyam nka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ nnɛ da yi, wama woanya abusua gyefo! Ɔmmɛyɛ okunini wɔ Israel. <verse eid="RUT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15"/>Akokoaa yi mma wo nsi wo mmabaabere mu na ɔnhwɛ wo wɔ wo mmerewabɔ mu. Efisɛ ɔyɛ wʼase a ɔdɔ wo na ɔsen mmabarima ason ma wo no babarima.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16"/>Na Naomi faa akokoaa no, na ɔhwɛɛ no te sɛ ɔno ankasa yafunu ba. <verse eid="RUT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17"/>Na mmea a wɔne no bɔ ofipam no kae se, “Afei de Naomi anya ɔbabarima bio.” Na wɔtoo no din Obed. Ɔno na ɔbɛyɛɛ Yisai agya ne Dawid nena.<verse eid="RUT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18"/>Tete agya Peres awo ntoatoaso ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="RUT 4:18"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:18">Peres woo Hesron.<verse eid="RUT 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19"/>Hesron woo Ram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:19">na Ram woo Aminadab.<verse eid="RUT 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20"/>Aminadab woo Nahson,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:20">na Nahson woo Salmon.<verse eid="RUT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21"/>Salmon woo Boas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:21">na Boas woo Obed.<verse eid="RUT 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22"/>Obed woo Yisai,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:22">na Yisai woo Dawid.<verse eid="RUT 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4"/>
</usx>
